{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14886","headline":"客舍苦雨即事寄钱起郎士元二员外 · 卢纶","name":"客舍苦雨即事寄钱起郎士元二员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积雨暮凄凄，羁人状鸟栖。\n响空宫树接，覆水野云低。\n穴蚁多随草，巢蜂半坠泥。\n遶池墙藓合，拥溜瓦松齐。\n旧圃平如海，新沟曲似溪。\n坏阑留衆蝶，欹栋止羣鸡。\n莠盛终无实，槎枯返有荑。\n绿萍藏废井，黄叶隐危堤。\n闾里欢将绝，朝昏望亦迷。\n不知霄汉侣，何路可相携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}